              <p class="timeline-desc">
                Led a 15-member team rebuilding a physician referral booking app (AngularJS → Angular 11).
                Implemented NGXS state management and Cypress E2E tests. Personally closed 60 defects vs team avg of 10–15, earning client recognition.
              </p>
