              <p class="timeline-desc">
                Rebuilt project from scratch (Angular 6 → Angular 12) with a custom Webpack builder.
                Built a reusable component library, Route Guards, auth token interceptor, and product showcase sites.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Achievements -->
      <div class="card card--achievements">
        <span class="eyebrow">HIGHLIGHTS</span>
        <h3>Achievements</h3>
        <ul class="achievement-list">
          <li>
            <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
            <span>Certified SAFe® 5 Practitioner — 2023</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
            <span>5K+ Stack Overflow reputation</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
            <span>Led a team of 15 developers at HCL</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
            <span>Closed 60 defects vs team avg of 10–15</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Education -->
      <div class="card card--education">
        <span class="eyebrow">BACKGROUND</span>
        <h3>Education</h3>
        <div class="edu-list">
          <div class="edu-item">
            <p class="edu-degree">PG — MBA Finance</p>
            <p class="edu-school">Azad College, Hyderabad</p>
